Description: Implements the Drum Machine Test (DMT), a psychTestR-based
    music psychology test that presents 16-step, three-instrument
    (hi-hat, snare, kick) drum patterns for perception and reproduction
    on an interactive sequencer grid. Supports stratified sampling of
    trials by pattern complexity and multiple languages, and exports
    trial-level results for item response modelling (e.g. the
    Item-Specific Learning Parameters model of Yu & Douglas, 2023).
